namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamWidgetTree {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetTree.h#DreamWidgetTree
    src   "Owns one widget hierarchy: the object every widget in that hierarchy is outered to.\n\nDreamUI used to outer widgets flat to the UWorld and keep the hierarchy only inside the prefab\nblob (FDreamUIPrefabSaveData::MapWidgetToParent), rebuilding it at load. That left no object\ngraph for the engine to serialize, duplicate or instance -- which is why a widget tree could not\nlive on a class template. The tree is that anchor.\n\nWidgets stay outered FLAT to the tree rather than nested under their parents, matching UMG, whose\nUWidgetTree::ConstructWidget outers every widget to the tree and expresses the hierarchy purely\nthrough Instanced properties. FObjectInstancingGraph follows those properties, not the outer\nchain, so a flat outer costs nothing -- and it means reparenting never has to move an outer,\nwhich keeps UObject::Rename (unsafe once an object has begun destruction) out of the attach path.\n\nUDreamWidget::GetWorld is the world of the level its outers reach -- that level's OwningWorld -- or\nelse the UWorld they reach, so an instance tree must be outered somewhere that reaches a level or a\nworld. A tree held as a class template deliberately is not: it returns no world,\nnever registers (registration is an explicit OnRegister call, never PostInitProperties) and is\nnever ticked."
    text  "拥有一个控件层级：该层级中每个控件的outer都指向此对象。\n\nDreamUI过去把控件的outer扁平地设为UWorld，层级只保留在预制体\nblob（FDreamUIPrefabSaveData::MapWidgetToParent）中，并在加载时重建。这样就没有可供\n引擎序列化、复制或实例化的对象图——这正是控件树无法\n存在于类模板上的原因。控件树就是这个锚点。\n\n控件仍扁平地以控件树为outer，而不嵌套在父控件之下，这与UMG一致，其\nUWidgetTree::ConstructWidget把每个控件的outer设为控件树，并仅\n通过Instanced属性表达层级。FObjectInstancingGraph跟随的是这些属性，而不是outer\n链，因此扁平的outer没有额外开销——而且这意味着更改父级从不需要移动outer，\n从而让UObject::Rename（对象开始销毁后即不安全）不出现在附加路径中。\n\nUDreamWidget::GetWorld返回其outer所到达的关卡的世界——即该关卡的OwningWorld——\n否则返回它们所到达的UWorld，因此实例树必须以能到达关卡或\n世界的对象为outer。而作为类模板持有的树则刻意不是：它不返回世界，\n从不注册（注册是显式的OnRegister调用，从不是PostInitProperties），也\n从不tick。"
    state machine
}

