DreamWidgetTree:FindWidgetByVariableName {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetTree.h#DreamWidgetTree:FindWidgetByVariableName
    src   "The first widget whose variable name matches, or null. Used to resolve a binding by name --\nUMG's UWidgetTree::GetWidgetFromName, and the same name the compiler declares variables from."
    text  "第一个变量名匹配的控件，没有则为null。用于按名称解析绑定——\n即UMG的UWidgetTree::GetWidgetFromName，也是编译器声明变量时所用的同一个名称。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetTree:GetAllWidgets {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetTree.h#DreamWidgetTree:GetAllWidgets
    src   "Every widget in the tree, root first, parents before children -- UMG's\nUWidgetTree::GetAllWidgets, and the Blueprint face of ForEachWidget, which takes a C++\npredicate no graph can supply."
    text  "树中的每个控件，根控件在前，父控件先于子控件——即UMG的\nUWidgetTree::GetAllWidgets，以及ForEachWidget的蓝图接口，它接受C++\n谓词，而蓝图无法提供。"
    state machine
}

